"""Small H reports from the single measured analysis; no policy actions."""
import json
from .core import read_json
from .partial_phase5h_evidence import location

def render(root,result):
    folder=location(root);verdict=result['verdict'];arms=result.get('arms',{});resources=read_json(folder/'resource-ledger.json') if (folder/'resource-ledger.json').exists() else {}
    lines=['# Phase 5H controlled goal-conditioning result','',f'Verdict: **{verdict}**.','',
        'Fresh DQN control H0 versus DQN H1 with lambda0.05 auxiliary direction cross-entropy, seed23141, same original B1 architecture and eight training cases. These are repeatedly used static development panels, not untouched validation/generalization evidence.','',
        '| Arm | Training actions | Checkpoint | Original success /4 | Expanded success /16 | U/D/L/R /4 | Expanded first alignment /16 | Wait / actions | Timeouts / collisions |',
        '|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|---:|---|---|']
    for arm,r in arms.items():
        for cp,n in r['checkpoints'].items():lines.append(f"| {arm} | {cp} | {cp} | {n['original_success']} | {n['expanded_success']} | {'/'.join(str(n['directions'][d]) for d in ('Up','Down','Left','Right'))} | {n['first_aligned']} | {n['wait_count']}/{n['actions']} | {n['timeouts']} / {n['collisions']} |")
    lines.extend(['',f"Difference-in-differences of expanded success gains: **{result.get('difference_in_differences','not_observed')}** cases; descriptive one seed only.",
        '', 'Fixed promising gates:', '', '```json',json.dumps(result.get('decision_checks',{}),indent=2),'```',
        '', '## What changed','',
        'H1 adds a Linear32-to-4 head from the second shared ReLU. Both shared Linear layers receive TD plus auxiliary gradient; the original five-action Q output receives TD only, and the extra projection receives auxiliary only. The original target Q network and its hard-copy schedule are unchanged. Original Adam has the head appended to its existing parameter group; the original single backward/update and policy-wide norm10 clipping handle the joint objective. The native DQN.train body is not rewritten. The auxiliary head never chooses or masks actions.','',
        'Direction labels come exclusively from the current public goal-position delta, largest-magnitude component, vertical-first ties; exact-goal samples are excluded. A correct coarse label is not an obstacle-aware optimal-action oracle. The task is potentially trivial; replay classification accuracy alone is not evidence of navigation improvement. This is not a parameter-count-controlled comparison.','',
        '## Actual learning evidence','',
        '| Arm | Goal encounters | Distinct goals sampled | Goal draws | Updates using goals | Optimizer steps | Training replay auxiliary accuracy |','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|'])
    for arm,r in arms.items():lines.append(f"| {arm} | {r['goal_encounters']} | {r['distinct_goals_sampled']} | {r['goal_sample_draws']} | {r['updates_with_goals']} | {r['optimizer_steps']} | {str(r['auxiliary_correct'])+'/'+str(r['auxiliary_training_draws']) if arm=='H1' else 'not_applicable'} |")
    lines.extend(['','Replay accuracy counts repeated optimizer draws, not distinct environments or development labels. All475 updates per arm record compact actual chosen Q/target-max/reward/mask/TD-target vectors, sample IDs/hashes, component losses/logits, gradient norms and optimizer/network fingerprints. Independent TD/Huber/cross-entropy/total arithmetic and replay joins were checked once; no later checkpoint inference substitutes for missing tensors. [Optimizer summaries](../artifacts/partial-dynamic-navigation-v1/phase5h-fast-goal-conditioning-v1/optimizer-summary.json), [all checkpoint metrics](../artifacts/partial-dynamic-navigation-v1/phase5h-fast-goal-conditioning-v1/checkpoint-metrics.csv), [all 80 case rows and first Q vectors](../artifacts/partial-dynamic-navigation-v1/phase5h-fast-goal-conditioning-v1/case-results.csv). Full action paths remain in cases-H0/H1.json and compact assessment ledgers.','',
        '## Pairing, resources and verification scope','', '```json',json.dumps(resources,indent=2),'```',''])
    if (folder/'pairing.json').exists():lines.extend(['Initial online/target Q equality and initial global/case/action RNG equality:','', '```json',json.dumps({k:v for k,v in read_json(folder/'pairing.json').items() if k!='initial_states'},indent=2),'```',''])
    if (folder/'train-receipts.json').exists():lines.extend(['Measured parameter counts and native optimizer/replay counters:','', '```json',json.dumps(read_json(folder/'train-receipts.json'),indent=2),'```',''])
    lines.extend(['Full legacy regression suite: **DEFERRED_TO_MAJOR_MILESTONE**. No claim that479 inherited tests passed in this phase. Focused tests and one isolated20-transition/six-optimizer-operation mechanical validation were completed before research, including the lambda0 fixed-minibatch comparison. No additional synthetic run or post-study test repeat was performed. Specific direct source/config hashes and inherited G verification/preservation receipts replaced a new 10k-file byte audit. The working-tree/commit scope is additions under H paths only; original dirty main HEAD/status/index are checked.','',
        'Not claimed here: G-level full gradient tensors, every five-Q training action vector, comprehensive forward/RNG-call census, live bitwise instrumentation equivalence, causal mechanism, statistical significance, generalization or a four-model ranking. Same-seed pairing fixes common initialization and initial RNG streams; trajectories need not stay identical after actions diverge. Parent training RNG/evidence and child weights/optimizer/RNG stayed unchanged by detached inference.','',
        'No extra seed, tuning, warm start, behavior cloning, reward shaping, action masking, planner fallback, supervised pretraining, reserved/final/unseen/dynamic task, full four-model training or Phase6. Stop after H.'])
    if 'error' in result:lines.extend(['','Recorded essential failure: `'+result['error']+'`. No research retry.'])
    (root/'docs/partial_phase5h_results.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n',encoding='utf-8',newline='\n')
    diagnosis=['# Phase 5H diagnosis','',f'Verdict: **{verdict}**.','',
        'The paired comparison changes one objective plus its necessary132-parameter head. It tests navigation outcomes, not just whether a network can decode an already visible direction. Direction accuracy, goal-reward optimizer membership and navigation success are separate observations. A single seed on familiar development pairs cannot identify a causal mechanism or establish a model ranking.','',
        'One follow-up recommendation: preregister a matched-capacity negative-control replication (same added head and parameter count, with a non-goal auxiliary target) before interpreting any favorable difference as goal-specific. This is outside the authorized pilot and was not run.','',
        'Stopped after Phase5H. No automatic continuation, Phase5I, full training, hidden/final assessment or Phase6.']
    (root/'docs/partial_phase5h_diagnosis.md').write_text('\n'.join(diagnosis)+'\n',encoding='utf-8',newline='\n')
